nd on the top of our heads.","start":933.72,"end":937.1,"words":[{"text":"We","start":933.72,"end":933.76},{"text":"can","start":933.76,"end":933.94},{"text":"place","start":933.94,"end":934.32},{"text":"the","start":934.32,"end":935.08},{"text":"right","start":935.08,"end":935.32},{"text":"hand","start":935.32,"end":935.7},{"text":"on","start":935.7,"end":935.96},{"text":"the","start":935.96,"end":936.08},{"text":"top","start":936.08,"end":936.24},{"text":"of","start":936.24,"end":936.42},{"text":"our","start":936.42,"end":936.6},{"text":"heads.","start":936.6,"end":937.1}]},{"text":"Massage, our Sahasrara, our seventh chakra. We can repeat this a couple of times.","start":938.32,"end":953.62,"words":[{"text":"Massage,","start":938.32,"end":939.42},{"text":"our","start":940.14,"end":940.24},{"text":"Sahasrara,","start":940.24,"end":941.7},{"text":"our","start":942.36,"end":942.48},{"text":"seventh","start":942.48,"end":942.78},{"text":"chakra.","start":942.78,"end":943.92},{"text":"We","start":950.58,"end":950.76},{"text":"can","start":950.76,"end":950.92},{"text":"repeat","start":950.92,"end":951.24},{"text":"this","start":951.24,"end":951.92},{"text":"a","start":951.92,"end":952.14},{"text":"couple","start":952.14,"end":952.32},{"text":"of","start":952.32,"end":952.66},{"text":"times.","start":952.66,"end":953.62}]},{"text":"And now let's stay in the present, forgetting all of our past, all negative experiences, free from any feelings of guilt.","start":995.74,"end":1008.98,"words":[{"text":"And","start":995.74,"end":996},{"text":"now","start":996,"end":996.26},{"text":"let's","start":996.26,"end":996.8},{"text":"stay","start":996.8,"end":997.26},{"text":"in","start":997.26,"end":997.44},{"text":"the","start":997.44,"end":997.52},{"text":"present,","start":997.52,"end":998.52},{"text":"forgetting","start":1000.2,"end":1000.62},{"text":"all","start":1000.62,"end":1001.38},{"text":"of","start":1001.84,"end":1002},{"text":"our","start":1002,"end":1002.16},{"text":"p